                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a644d25f-54a3-47d0-84ec-d9953e94ff3a",
                                                "sense_id": "a13b5887-f920-3896-9712-59c699e9b54a",
                                                "text": "Let our actor, in the true spirit of imitating his betters, follow the example of the great Mr. K⁠—⁠n; that is, let him roll about through the day from pot-house to pot-house like a rumbling old beer barrel, with ten or a dozen noggins of Geneva in his pate."
